    "statement": "Another replicated, controlled study in Ireland found that rockcook cleaner wrasse were ineffective at preventing lice outbreaks.",
    "citations": [
      "738"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "A study in Scotland recorded lower lice numbers on salmon in cages that used a fallowing system.",
    "citations": [
      "1026"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "An Australian study on Amoebic Gill Disease mortality found no difference with fallowing.",
    "citations": [
      "1026"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "A replicated, controlled study in Norway reported lower lice numbers on salmon kept under low-intensity artificial light or natural lighting.",
    "citations": [
      "741"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "The study in Norway found that higher artificial light intensity was associated with higher lice numbers on salmon.",
    "citations": [
      "741"
    ]
